# Commit message contains a "Generated with" note (ADR-0038)
command: cargo xtask commits HEAD^..HEAD
expect: AI attribution in the commit message: `🤖 Generated with Claude Code`
message: docs: tweak theme notes\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code
--- patch
diff --git a/docs/design/theme.md b/docs/design/theme.md
--- a/docs/design/theme.md
+++ b/docs/design/theme.md
@@ -84,3 +84,5 @@
 (ADR-0020). Texts are short and without exclamation marks, workspace captions in capitals
 (DESIGN, SKETCH …). Units are always shown (`20 mm`). The decimal separator follows
 the language (`15.70` / `15,70 cm³`).
+
+Sabotage.
